OL,3,AI'd rather pay thousands on a holiday:
OL,4,AMeet the pensioners spending the kids'
OL,5,Ainheritance
OL,6,
OL,7,FHappily retired, Sarah Moorhouse is
OL,8,Fusing her private pension "to go places
OL,9,Fand do nice things at the drop of a
OL,10,Fhat".
OL,12,FWhile other retirees with a decent
OL,13,Fmonthly pension income may choose to
OL,14,Fbuild up an inheritance for their
OL,15,Fchildren, Sarah, 64, and her husband
OL,16,FGeoff are opting to spend their money
OL,17,Fon living life to the max.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
FL,119,105,200,300,0,100
