OL,3,AI'd rather pay thousands on a holiday:
OL,4,AMeet the pensioners spending the kids'
OL,5,Ainheritance
OL,6,
OL,7,F"We like going to Scotland," says
OL,8,FSarah, a retired school administrator.
OL,9,F"We've been down to Cambridgeshire,
OL,10,Fwhich was lovely. We go up to the Lake
OL,11,FDistrict quite regularly to a holiday
OL,12,Fcottage, and we're planning to go to
OL,13,FNorfolk."
OL,15,FThe couple, who live in the Yorkshire
OL,16,FDales, go on holiday four or five times
OL,17,Fa year, spending hundreds of pounds
OL,18,Feach time because, in Sarah's view,
OL,19,F"you only have one opportunity at
OL,20,Flife".
